# =============================================================================
# SafeConstruct — master environment reference
# =============================================================================
# Each workspace reads its OWN env file. This file just documents what each one
# needs; the real, copy-from templates live next to each package:
#
#   contracts/.env.example  ->  copy to  contracts/.env
#   web/.env.example        ->  copy to  web/.env
#
# The real .env files are gitignored — never commit secrets.
# =============================================================================

# ----- contracts/.env --------------------------------------------------------
# DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY   account that deploys the contract (= admin/relayer)
# POLYGON_AMOY_RPC_URL   RPC endpoint for testnet deploys

# ----- web/.env --------------------------------------------------------------
# DATABASE_URL                   off-chain DB — Supabase POOLED Postgres URL (6543)
# DIRECT_URL                     Supabase DIRECT Postgres URL (5432) for migrations
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL       Supabase project URL (browser-safe)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  Supabase anon key (browser-safe)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY      Supabase service-role key (SERVER-ONLY, bypasses RLS)
# ADMIN_EMAILS                   comma-separated emails auto-promoted to ADMIN
# CHAIN_TARGET                   "localhost" or "amoy"
# LOCALHOST_RPC_URL              local Hardhat node URL
# AMOY_RPC_URL                   Polygon Amoy testnet URL
# WALLET_ENCRYPTION_KEY          32-byte hex key for encrypting custodial wallet keys
# RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY            backend gas payer + contract admin
#
# The deployed contract ADDRESS is not an env var — the deploy script writes it
# (with the ABI) into web/src/lib/chain/generated.ts.
